{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicVolumeMeasure","lean:module:Mathlib.MeasureTheory.Group.FundamentalDomain"],"declarations":34,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.hypVolume_eq_slab_of_isAddFundamentalDomain","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.hypVolume_eq_slab_of_isAddFundamentalDomain","kind":"theorem","line":314,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L314-L322","doc":"**The volume of `H³ / latticeE₀` is well defined and computed by the slab.**\n\nInstantiates §4 at the fundamental domain of §6: any other fundamental domain for this\nlattice carries the same hyperbolic volume. Nothing here is assumed — the invariance\ncame from `hypDensity`, and the domain was exhibited. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.isAddFundamentalDomain_slab","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.isAddFundamentalDomain_slab","kind":"theorem","line":281,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L281-L312","doc":"**The slab is a fundamental domain for the rank-1 lattice.**\n\nExistence and uniqueness of the representative are the two halves of `Int.fract`: the\ntranslate landing in the slab is `-⌊x 0⌋`, and two integers whose difference is less\nthan `1` in absolute value are equal. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.measurableSet_slab","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.measurableSet_slab","kind":"theorem","line":278,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L278-L279","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.slab","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.slab","kind":"def","line":275,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L275-L276","doc":"**The unit slab** in the first coordinate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.instCountableSubtypeForallFinOfNatNatRealMemAddSubgroupLatticeE₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.instCountableSubtypeForallFinOfNatNatRealMemAddSubgroupLatticeE₀","kind":"instance","line":271,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L271-L273","doc":"**The lattice is countable** — required by `IsAddFundamentalDomain.measure_eq`,\nand true because the lattice is the image of `ℤ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.ofInt_surjective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.ofInt_surjective","kind":"theorem","line":265,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L265-L269","doc":"`ofInt` is onto the lattice: every element is an integer multiple of `e₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.coe_ofInt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.coe_ofInt","kind":"theorem","line":263,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L263-L263","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.ofInt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.ofInt","kind":"def","line":259,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L259-L261","doc":"The lattice element determined by an integer. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.exists_zsmul_of_mem_latticeE₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.exists_zsmul_of_mem_latticeE₀","kind":"theorem","line":253,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L253-L257","doc":"Every element of the rank-1 lattice is an integer multiple of `e₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.zsmul_e₀_apply_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.zsmul_e₀_apply_zero","kind":"theorem","line":249,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L249-L251","doc":"Evaluating an integer multiple of `e₀` at the first coordinate returns the integer. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.latticeE₀_ne_bot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.latticeE₀_ne_bot","kind":"theorem","line":230,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L230-L236","doc":"**The concrete lattice is nontrivial**, so §4 is not a statement about the trivial\ngroup acting on itself. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.e₀_mem_latticeE₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.e₀_mem_latticeE₀","kind":"theorem","line":228,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L228-L228","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.instIsHorizontalLatticeE₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.instIsHorizontalLatticeE₀","kind":"instance","line":226,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L226-L226","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.latticeE₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.latticeE₀","kind":"def","line":223,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L223-L224","doc":"The rank-1 lattice along `e₀`: a concrete nonzero horizontal group. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.isHorizontal_zmultiples","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.isHorizontal_zmultiples","kind":"instance","line":212,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L212-L221","doc":"**The rank-1 lattice generated by a horizontal vector is a horizontal group.**\n\n`AddSubgroup.zmultiples v` is `{n • v | n : ℤ}`; it is horizontal whenever `v` is, and\nit is countable, so it satisfies every hypothesis §4 needs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.isHorizontal_closure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.isHorizontal_closure","kind":"theorem","line":203,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L203-L210","doc":"**Any group generated by horizontal vectors is horizontal.**\n\nStated for a general generating set so the rank-2 lattice — the one whose quotient is\nan actual cusp — satisfies §1–§4 without further work, even though §6 exhibits a\nfundamental domain only in the rank-1 case. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.e₀_mem_horizontal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.e₀_mem_horizontal","kind":"theorem","line":201,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L201-L201","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.e₀_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.e₀_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L196-L199","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.e₀_height","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.e₀_height","kind":"theorem","line":194,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L194-L194","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.e₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.e₀","kind":"def","line":191,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L191-L192","doc":"The unit vector along the first axis — horizontal and nonzero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.hypVolume_eq_of_isAddFundamentalDomain","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.hypVolume_eq_of_isAddFundamentalDomain","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L173-L183","doc":"**The hyperbolic volume of `H³/Γ` does not depend on the fundamental domain.**\n\nThis is what it means for the quotient to *have* a volume. Compare\n`Encounter.MostowRigidity.volume`, which is a real supplied by an instance — here the\nnumber is determined by the measure and the group. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.vadd_ne_of_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.vadd_ne_of_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L164-L166","doc":"Contrapositive form: a nonzero element fixes nothing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.eq_zero_of_vadd_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.eq_zero_of_vadd_eq","kind":"theorem","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L156-L162","doc":"**The action is free**: a group element fixing any point is the identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.vadd_right_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.vadd_right_injective","kind":"theorem","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L152-L154","doc":"Translation by a fixed group element is injective. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.vaddInvariantMeasure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.vaddInvariantMeasure","kind":"instance","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L137-L144","doc":"**`Γ` preserves hyperbolic volume — the load-bearing fact.**\n\nDischarged by the corpus's `hypVolume_add_left`, whose `v 2 = 0` hypothesis is exactly\nmembership in `horizontal`. This instance is what lets the quotient volume below be\n*derived* rather than posited. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.vadd_mem_upperHalfSpace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.vadd_mem_upperHalfSpace","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L131-L135","doc":"**`Γ` acts on `H³`.** A translation with a vertical component would move points out\nof (or into) the upper half-space; a horizontal one cannot. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.vadd_height","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.vadd_height","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L126-L129","doc":"**Height is unchanged.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.vadd_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.vadd_def","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L118-L119","doc":"The subgroup acts by translation, definitionally. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.height_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.height_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L114-L116","doc":"Every element of a horizontal group has zero height. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.IsHorizontal.le_horizontal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.IsHorizontal.le_horizontal","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L110-L110","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.IsHorizontal.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.IsHorizontal.mk","kind":"ctor","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L109-L109","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.IsHorizontal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.IsHorizontal","kind":"class","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L105-L110","doc":"A group of translations that are isometries of `H³`.\n\nCarried as a class so the invariance instance below resolves automatically. It asserts\na real containment, not a marker. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.mem_horizontal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.mem_horizontal","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L103-L103","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.horizontal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicQuotient.horizontal","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HyperbolicQuotient.lean#L89-L101","doc":"**The horizontal vectors** — those with zero height. Translations by these are\nisometries of `H³`; translations by anything else are not. ","signatureChunk":0}]}